@startuml AgentPay Seller Integration Sequence
!theme plain
title AgentPay — Automated Seller Integration

actor Seller
participant "Coding agent\nClaude Code / Codex / MCP host" as CodingAgent
participant "AgentPay MCP" as MCP
participant "AgentPay API" as API
participant "Seller repository" as Repository
participant "Seller API" as SellerAPI

Seller -> CodingAgent : Request AgentPay integration
CodingAgent -> Repository : Inspect API contract and supported routes
CodingAgent -> MCP : Read integration resources and seller configuration
MCP -> API : Authorize seller-scoped read operations
API --> MCP : Current storefront and route state
MCP --> CodingAgent : Bounded configuration and templates
CodingAgent -> Repository : Prepare middleware, storefront, configuration, and tests
CodingAgent --> Seller : Present diff, proposed products, prices, and deployment plan
Seller -> CodingAgent : Explicitly approve publication
CodingAgent -> MCP : Create or update confirmed products
MCP -> API : Idempotent scoped mutations
API --> MCP : Published route identifiers
CodingAgent -> SellerAPI : Run sandbox verification
SellerAPI --> CodingAgent : Valid signed fulfillment response
CodingAgent --> Seller : Integration ready for explicit deployment approval
@enduml
